          H1i: F1i (FHS print geometry, same mesh settings) with EPU 45 VISCO-HYPERELASTIC (Yeoh C10/C20/C30 2.4/0.15/0.02 MPa long-term, Prony g1 0.958, tau1 52 us, nu 0.49, both models); impactor 45 N mm at 6 m/s, T 4 ms. F1i: FHS-joint twin of B2i (the print geometry, src/nodeJoint.py, instead of cylinders + joint spheres; gmsh tets from the FHS STL, C3D10M h 0.3 mm, distortion control, T 3 ms). ONE C4 unit cell, GRADED radii (Midplane: top 1.0, bottom 0.6, mid 0.8) as a SOLID (C3D10M, h 0.3 mm), bottom clamped, t
